title: 'pallet-revive: test the access items against actual reads and writes'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests that compare the entries each access item names with the keys an operation
      actually reads and writes, so a declaration cannot drift from the code unnoticed. No
      runtime behaviour changes.

crates:
  - name: pallet-revive
    bump: none
